@startuml
actor Dosen
participant Client
participant MataKuliahController as Controller
participant MataKuliahService as Service
participant PemetaanCplMk as Pemetaan
database DB

Client -> Controller: POST /mata-kuliah/{id}/map-cpl { mappings }
Controller -> Service: saveCplMapping(id, mappings)
Service -> Service: validateMappings(mappings)
Service -> Pemetaan: destroy({ where: { siakMataKuliahId: id } })
Service -> Pemetaan: bulkCreate(mappings)
Pemetaan -> DB: INSERT rows
Service -> DB: update mata_kuliah.status_pemetaan = true
Service --> Controller: { success: true }
Controller --> Client: 200 OK

note right of Service: validations: cek CPL & CPMK exist, total bobot per CPL
@enduml
